<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia International (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>			 buying rate     selling rate</p>
<p>U.S dollar	   40.15	     40.20</p>
<p>Pound Sterling     63.10	     63.20</p>
<p>Deutsche mark	26.20	     26.25</p>
<p>Japanese yen	  0.361	     0.363</p>
<p>Saudi riyal	  10.69	     10.71</p>
<p>UAE dirham	   10.93	     10.95</p>
<p>Indian rupee	  1.09		1.11</p>
<p>F.E.B.C		 8.35 pct	  8.55 pct</p>
</text>
